abstract: >-
  A living, controlled, traceable research-honesty methodology: portable
  tooling that programmes can clone or pin. Borrowed techniques require
  citations via a lineage ledger; PRs that add features must pass admission
  validation.
keywords:
  - research methodology
  - epistemic honesty
  - lineage
  - reproducible research
  - living paper
